# Agent workflow

- One concern per PR (content ≠ CMP ≠ generator UX ≠ docs). Branch from latest `main` as `cursor/<name>-1fce`. Open PR; do not merge unless asked.
- Before planning growth, SEO, or content work: read `docs/GROWTH-STATUS.md`.
- **Every PR must update `README.md` and `docs/GROWTH-STATUS.md`** with **Done** / **Remaining** for what changed and what is still open (no invented metrics).
- Follow `AGENTS.md` standing rules (especially **SEO state (as of 2026-11-15)** — IndexNow, GSC/Bing, settled jev-seo false alarms) and the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/` before inventing a new process.
- Pre-merge gate: `npm test && npm run audit` (includes indexing sitemap self-canonical check; see `pre-merge-seo-aeo-checklist`).
